        "explanation": "The \"requires feed_polling_url\" and \"requires embed_by_username\" examples stub only one setting. feed_polling_enabled defaults to false in config/site_settings.yml:355, and neither example stubs it to true. The first condition in execute (app/jobs/scheduled/poll_feed.rb:15) is therefore false, and poll_feed is never called. That holds even if the url or username checks were removed from execute, so the examples do not test what they claim.",
